msgid ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"The Executor primitive is part of the [directed execution model](/guides/directed-execution-model), which provides more flexibility when customizing an error mitigation workflow.\n"
msgstr ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
